<title>USA: Handleman Co stake cut by investor Harrosh.</title>
<headline>Handleman Co stake cut by investor Harrosh.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>California investor Joseph Harrosh on Thursday said he reduced his stake in Handleman Co to 4,265,600 common shares, or 12.74 percent of the total.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Harrosh said he sold 593,300 shares of the home entertainment merchandiser between April 14 and April 16, including the sale of 300,000 shares at $7.625 each on April 16.</p>
</text>
